            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aggiungi <code>\"windy\"</code> a questo array delle previsioni meteorologiche.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"var\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" forecast = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;sunny&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;cloudy&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"forecast.append(\" /><text value=\"&quot;windy&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(forecast)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"removeLast\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;rainy&quot;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"35\" endIndex=\"43\" /><option startIndex=\"43\" endIndex=\"50\" /><option startIndex=\"51\" endIndex=\"58\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[&quot;sunny&quot;, &quot;cloudy&quot;, &quot;windy&quot;] \" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>forecast</code>, seguito da <code>.append</code> e infine <code>\"windy\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
